From 8643b2d4a916e68c21efa6569464d16115d11180 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 06:26:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Modular refactor: reusable widget system + Home/Settings
 decomposition (Task 121)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Parallel-agent refactor (lead + 5 agents, ownership matrix enforced):
- HorseTheme additive tokens: semantic colors (hairline, scrimPoster/Strong,
  danger, success, progressRed, imdbYellow), radii, motion (emphasized curve,
  dur fast/med/slow), gutter() + breakpoints — one design-token source.
- NEW shared AppStateMessage (replaces 9 near-identical state widgets across
  live_tv, catalog browser/grid, calendar; pixel-identical per-site params).
- NEW shared ShimmerBox (moved verbatim from detail_hero + export shim).
- Home 2216→586 lines: FeaturedHero / ContinueWatchingRail (+CwCardData,
  ContinueCard, LinkedContinue*) / AsyncMediaSection / RailLoadingSkeleton /
  HomeSectionHeader under features/home/widgets/ — triplicated CW geometry
  solved once (_CwRailMetrics) and 3x gold-bar header unified.
- Settings kit: SettingsTile + SettingsSectionTitle extracted, settings_page
  rewired (390→323 L); near-miss rows deliberately kept local.
- media_rail gold literal → HorseTheme.gold.

Zero behavior/UI change (QA 121-e: SHIP, all audits PASS). Gates: analyze
clean, 151/151 tests = baseline. v1.2.24+27
